{"page":173,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:171","surah":7,"ayah":171,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذْ نَتَقْنَا ٱلْجَبَلَ فَوْقَهُمْ كَأَنَّهُۥ ظُلَّةٌ وَظَنُّوٓا۟ أَنَّهُۥ وَاقِعٌۢ بِهِمْ خُذُوا۟ مَآ ءَاتَيْنَـٰكُم بِقُوَّةٍ وَٱذْكُرُوا۟ مَا فِيهِ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When We made the mountain loom high above them like a shadow, and they thought it would fall on them, We said, ‘Hold fast to what We have given you, and remember what it contains, so that you may remain conscious of God.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَتَقْنَا","en_gloss":"We raised","transliteration":"nataqnā","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْجَبَلَ","en_gloss":"the mountain","transliteration":"l-jabala","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَوْقَهُمْ","en_gloss":"above them","transliteration":"fawqahum","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَأَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"as if it was","transliteration":"ka-annahu","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ظُلَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a canopy","transliteration":"ẓullatun","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَظَنُّوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and they thought","transliteration":"waẓannū","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"that it","transliteration":"annahu","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَاقِعٌۢ","en_gloss":"(would) fall","transliteration":"wāqiʿun","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهِمْ","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خُذُوا۟","en_gloss":"(We said), \"Take","transliteration":"khudhū","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰكُم","en_gloss":"We have given you","transliteration":"ātaynākum","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِقُوَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"with strength","transliteration":"biquwwatin","verse_key":"7:171"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and remember","transliteration":"wa-u