o, before us, ascribed partners to God, and we are only the descendants who came after them: will you destroy us because of falsehoods they invented?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقُولُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"you say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَشْرَكَ","en_gloss":"partners (were) associated (with Allah)","transliteration":"ashraka","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَابَآؤُنَا","en_gloss":"(by) our forefathers","transliteration":"ābāunā","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before (us)","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَكُنَّا","en_gloss":"and we are","transliteration":"wakunnā","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"descendants","transliteration":"dhurriyyatan","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْدِهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"after them","transliteration":"baʿdihim","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَفَتُهْلِكُنَا","en_gloss":"So will You destroy us","transliteration":"afatuh'likunā","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَعَلَ","en_gloss":"did","transliteration":"faʿala","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ","en_gloss":"the falsifiers","transliteration":"l-mub'ṭilūna","verse_key":"7:173"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٧٣","en_gloss":"(173)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:173"}]},{"verse_key":"7:174","surah":7,"ayah":174,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ نُفَصِّلُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ وَلَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In this way We explain the messages, so that they may turn [to the right path].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَك