":11,"ar":"فَكَانَ","en_gloss":"and he became","transliteration":"fakāna","verse_key":"7:175"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:175"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْغَاوِينَ","en_gloss":"those gone astray","transliteration":"l-ghāwīna","verse_key":"7:175"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٧٥","en_gloss":"(175)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:175"}]},{"verse_key":"7:176","surah":7,"ayah":176,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ شِئْنَا لَرَفَعْنَـٰهُ بِهَا وَلَـٰكِنَّهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَ إِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَٱتَّبَعَ هَوَىٰهُ ۚ فَمَثَلُهُۥ كَمَثَلِ ٱلْكَلْبِ إِن تَحْمِلْ عَلَيْهِ يَلْهَثْ أَوْ تَتْرُكْهُ يَلْهَث ۚ ذَّٰلِكَ مَثَلُ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا ۚ فَٱقْصُصِ ٱلْقَصَصَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"if it had been Our will, We could have used these signs to raise him high, but instead he clung to the earth and followed his own desires- he was like a dog that pants with a lolling tongue whether you drive it away or leave it alone. Such is the image of those who reject Our signs. Tell them the story so that they may reflect.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":2,"ar":"شِئْنَا","en_gloss":"We willed","transliteration":"shi'nā","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَرَفَعْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"surely, We (could) have raised him","transliteration":"larafaʿnāhu","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"with these","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"[and] but he","transliteration":"walākinnahu","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَخْلَدَ","en_gloss":"adhered","transliteration":"akhlada","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"7:176"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱتَّبَعَ","en_gloss":"and followed","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿa","verse_key":"7:176"},